Third-party data sources (facts, not code): electrical parameters and pinouts
transcribed from publicly available datasheets by Texas Instruments, onsemi
(Motorola), Nexperia, and Fairchild; each chip definition cites its sources in
src/data/chips.ts and docs/datasheet-sources.md. Pinout cross-checks referenced
against the MIT-licensed cocot-gf/Logisim-BIG-TTL-CMOS-Library catalog. No
third-party code or graphics are embedded.
